OL,3,AZimbabwean author denies using AI to
OL,4,Awrite award-winning story
OL,5,
OL,6,FZimbabwean writer Simbarashe Kundizeza
OL,7,Fhas denied using artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence (AI) to write his short
OL,9,Fstory, which won this year's Caine
OL,10,FPrize for African Writing.
OL,12,FHis statement comes a week after he
OL,13,Fscooped the #10,000 ($13,000) award and
OL,14,Fa recent article in The Atlantic said
OL,15,FAI-detection software Pangram had shown
OL,16,Fhis work about a boy whose family falls
OL,17,Fon hard times was entirely AI
OL,18,Fgenerated.
OL,20,F"For the avoidance of doubt, I wrote
OL,21,FThe Blue Fighter," he posted on X.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
