OL,3,AZimbabwean author denies using AI to
OL,4,Awrite award-winning story
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe accusation has caused an uproar on
OL,7,Fsocial media and Caine Prize chair
OL,8,FEllah Wakatama told the BBC she was
OL,9,Fshocked that the US magazine had not
OL,10,Fwaited for a full investigation before
OL,11,Fpublishing.
